---
// Small caps pill with a lit dot: the release status, stated once.
---

<p class="pill"><slot /></p>

<style>
  .pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 7px 15px 7px 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--accent-rgb) / 0.28);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgb(var(--accent-rgb) / 0.07);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-bright);
  }

  .pill::before {
    content: "";
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
